 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Kanjou wo Korosu no wo Yameta Moto Koushaku Reijou wa, Minna ni Dekiaisareteimasu!"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "感情を殺すのをやめた元公爵令嬢は、みんなに溺愛されています！ @COMIC"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "The entrance ceremony at a noble academy. The girl who had not smiled for more than ten years had a big smile on her face. Brenda's engagement was broken off and she was disowned by her father, who told her to suppress her emotions, and she became a commoner. She is at rock bottom, and her goal is to find a secure job in research. It was supposed to be a lonely school life filled with studying, but there was no way the people around her would leave her in the dark about the changes she was going through!\n\nA handsome, misanthropic senior recognizes her as a cute junior. A childhood friend proposes to her. Her former fiancé, Prince Charming, asks her to dance with him. She is thrown into the middle of a love triangle...? The story is about a young man who is in love with his former daughter, who has been a waitress for a long time. How will the former daughter, who had been a quiet person, turn out to be?",
   "ja": "感情を表現することを父に禁じられていた公爵令嬢のブレンダは、無表情であることが原因で婚約者であるアレクシスから婚約破棄を言い渡される。さらに父から公爵家を追放され「平民」になった彼女は、安定した職に就くために全寮制の学園に入学。勉学に励む決心をする。何にも縛られず、自分らしく学園生活を送ろうとしたブレンダ。しかし彼女の身に様々な変化が起きる。かつて婚約者のライバルであったミランが友達になったり、アレクシスが何かと声をかけてきたり、従兄のルドフィルと距離が縮まったり…。予想だにしなかったイベント続出で、この学園生活、思っていた以上に楽しいかも…!?"
  },
